    "A 'Health education' action in the consultation and the patient's chart: topic, method (Verbal, Leaflet, Written instructions, Demonstration, Video), given to (Patient, Attendant, Both), the material (required for a leaflet or a video: GET /education/materials), a note; in a consultation send its encounter_id.",
